msgstr ""

#: src/step/edit.js:242
msgid "Let the image scroll along"
msgstr ""

#: src/step/edit.js:246
msgid "The image does not stay in place. It fills the screen at the start of this step and scrolls away with it, while the medium of the next step already shows behind it. An image taller than the screen keeps its height and makes the step as tall as itself, unless the step has a height of its own, which the image then fills. Front end only; has no effect inside a row."
msgstr ""

